any guilt [for remaining behind]. And whoever obeys Allāh and His Messenger - He will admit him to gardens beneath which rivers flow; but whoever turns away - He will punish him with a painful punishment.","j":26,"h":51,"s":48,"a":17,"sd":null},{"k":"48:18","t":"Certainly was Allāh pleased with the believers when they pledged allegiance to you, [O Muḥammad], under the tree, and He knew what was in their hearts, so He sent down tranquility upon them and rewarded them with an imminent conquest","j":26,"h":52,"s":48,"a":18,"sd":null},{"k":"48:19","t":"And much war booty which they will take. And ever is Allāh Exalted in Might and Wise.","j":26,"h":52,"s":48,"a":19,"sd":null},{"k":"48:20","t":"Allāh has promised you much booty that you will take [in the future] and has hastened for you this [victory] and withheld the hands of people from you - that it may be a sign for the believers and [that] He may guide you to a straight path.","j":26,"h":52,"s":48,"a":20,"sd":null},{"k":"48:21","t":"And [He promises] other [victories] that you were [so far] unable to [realize] which Allāh has already encompassed. And ever is Allāh, over all things, competent.","j":26,"h":52,"s":48,"a":21,"sd":null},{"k":"48:22","t":"And if those [Makkans] who disbelieve had fought you, they would have turned their backs [in flight]. Then they would not find a protector or a helper.","j":26,"h":52,"s":48,"a":22,"sd":null},{"k":"48:23","t":"[This is] the established way of Allāh which has occurred before. And never will you find in the way of Allāh any change.","j":26,"h":52,"s":48,"a":23,"sd":null}],"juz":26,"hizb":51,"surahs":[48],"sajdah":false}